        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I’espace BM3 hosted my surprise party this past weekend. I was blown away by the beautiful set up.\nThe communication and professionalism throughout the process was wonderful but I was not expecting this level of set up, It made the day even more special.\nThe space is very versatile and can be used for a multitude of events.\nThey are obviously very experienced and organized.",
