        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carissa Thomas-Desmond",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112687730486445505529/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWs-EbIYaWnqSSJ1uy6zeNULkcDRKNuotmMiGDR7SJgSY5GKQo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "absolutely incredible woman owned business! These incredible ladies came together to give my daughter the best party to remember. Laura and Cassidy were animated and friendly. handled every situation and child with patience and care. they embraced my daughters love for science and went above and beyond to make her day special! highly recommend and i personally look forward to having more parties there in the future!",
        "time": 1759858386,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
