        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "What a great birthday party experience! Amanda was amazing to work with, great communication and so nice 😊 The place was beautiful and perfectly decorated for our son’s 6th Birthday. Everyone of all ages had a great time. Laura was amazing with the kids 😊 Thank you BM3!!",
        "time": 1762356531,
        "translated": false
      },
