        "text": "we wanted to thank you so much for going above and beyond to make sure we had the best experience at your space\nfrom the beginning to the end was a great time 😊\nthe balloons and decorations were amazing\nwe thank you for all the extras you did\nwe highly recommend L'espace BM3\nand will definetly be renting again\nthank you  Amanda , Audrey and your great staff\nsue and george",
